WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999
This is Pandarithm, a web-based structural engineering application I've been
developing.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.999
It provides interactive tools for structural analysis, reinforced concrete
design, and steel design.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.999
For example, in the beam analysis module, users can define supports, specify
spans, and apply loading conditions.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.999
The application uses finite element formulations and the matrix stiffness
method to calculate reactions, shear forces, bending moments, and deflections.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.999
I've also implemented engineering design calculations, code-based checks, and
validation tests to compare computed results against established solutions.

6
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.999
Pandarithm is currently in beta, with ongoing improvements to design coverage
and verification.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.999
This project demonstrates how I combine structural engineering principles with
programming to develop practical engineering tools.
